<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Your request to switch your major has been received; however, we are unable to complete the change because you are already enrolled in classes for your current major.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">To finalize your change of majors, please contact your academic advisor. You can find your advisor in the <a href="https://students.asu.edu/advising/directory">advising directory</a>.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions, feel free to contact me at&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</span>. I am your personal&nbsp;contact for admission-related questions, and I’ll be happy to help you through the admission process.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: Times; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Pone__c}</font></div></div></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>